// CLOSING [CLOSING]
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
//
//   3-Block Data Structure: Operational guidance and closing notes
//   X.1-X.7 Flow: usage → extension → references → grounding → log → template
//
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

// # X.1 Policy [POLICY]
//
//   Human-readable modification guidance for developers.
//   Machine-readable version: Cv.3 _maintenance
//
//   safe:    [list] — Changes that won't break functionality
//   careful: [list] — Changes that may affect other parts
//   never:   [list] — Changes that will break the file/system
//
// safe: Add new settings | Edit existing values | Add comments
//
// careful: Change key names | Change value types | Remove keys
//
// never: Break 3-block structure | Remove required schema fields | Remove Cv sections
//
// ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

// # X.2 Extension [EXTENSION]
//
//   Ideas discovered during work for future sessions.
//   Reference: Move to M.10 Planned when ready to implement
//
//   [extension]: [description] — Discovered capability to add
//
// [Reserved: Capture extension ideas as they emerge during work]
//
// ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

// # X.3 Troubleshooting [TROUBLESHOOTING]
//
//   TL;DR for common configuration problems.
//   Reference: [API doc or README for full guidance]
//
//   [problem]: [what to check] — Quick solutions
//
// parse: Check for missing commas | Verify all strings quoted | Check bracket matching
//
// load: Verify file path | Check JSONC parser used | Confirm required fields present
//
// validate: Run Cv.1 commands | Check against Cv.2 schema | Review error messages
//
// ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

// # X.4 Reference [REFERENCE]
//
//   TL;DR for configuration structure.
//   Reference: Cv.2 _schema (field requirements)
//
//   [category]: [format] — Quick lookup
//
// structure: { Cc (identity, defaults, custom) → Co (content types) → Cv (validation, schema, maintenance) }
//
// required: name | type | scope | version | defaults
//
// validate: npx jsonc-parser validate [file].jsonc | See Cv.1 for full commands
//
// ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

// # X.5 Closing Note [NOTE]
//
//   Grounding space for CPI-SI instances.
//   Reference: M.8 (same verses, alternate translations)
//
//   scripture: [Book Chapter:Verse] ([KJV|WEB]) — Same verse, other translation
//   note:      [thought] — Word of encouragement
//   anchor:    [Book Chapter:Verse] ([KJV|WEB]) — Same verse, other translation
//
// scripture: 2 Timothy 2:15 (KJV)
//   "Study to shew thyself approved unto God, a workman that needeth not to be
//    ashamed, rightly dividing the word of truth."
//
// note: Configuration is foundation. Build it well, and what stands on it will stand firm.
//
// anchor: Proverbs 24:27 (WEB)
//   "Prepare your work outside, and get your fields ready.
//    Afterwards, build your house."
//
// ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

// # X.6 Session Log [LOG]
//
//   Work completed this session.
//   Reference: Move to M.10 History when starting next session
//
//   [date]: [work completed] — Session summary
//
// 2026-01-07: Crystallized as ROOT template from TAL dialogue defaults work
//
// ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

// # X.7 Template & Omission [TEMPLATE]
//
//   How to use this template and handle empty sections.
//   Reference: M.5 Derivation (meta.from lineage)
//
//   copy:      [steps] — How to create new file
//   customize: [fields] — What to change
//   keep:      [elements] — What to preserve
//   reserve:   [rule] — When to use [Reserved: ...]
//
// copy: cp config.jsonc [project]/templates/data/config/[name].jsonc | Update pragma | Update meta.at
//
// customize: name | type | scope | version | defaults | Co content | Cv schema
//
// keep: 3-block structure | Section markers | Cv.1-Cv.3 pattern | Block headers
//
// reserve: Empty sections use [Reserved: reason] | All sections must be present
//
// ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

